  "goodToKnow": "Die Abwicklung is the processing or handling of something (die Abwicklung von Zahlungen, eine reibungslose Abwicklung) and the winding up of a business: die Abwicklung einer Bank. After reunification, many GDR institutions, factories and university departments were abgewickelt (wound up) by the Treuhand, a word that still carries bitter memories in eastern Germany. The verb is abwickeln. Plural: die Abwicklungen."
